            "review_title": "Review at Nhà hàng Chân Trời Góc Bể",
            "review_text": "Justin L\nSan Francisco, California21 contributions\n0\nGreat food and amazing ambiance\nMar 2025 • Friends\nWe came here for lunch on a Friday. This by far the best meal we've had since we've landed here in Da Nang. We ordered a whole grilled fish, the fried rice, watercress veggies stir fry, veal stir fry and grilled squid. All of the fished were nicely flavored and especially the fried rice which had a bit of crunch mixed in the rice. This is such a great spot overlooking the bay with a nice breeze. The best of all was the special attentive service we received including refilled of your drinks, they move things around to make room for dishes that they served, and advised on on how to enjoy the dishes. Definitely a place we would visit next time we're here in Da Nang\nRead more\nWritten March 29, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
