            "review_title": "Review at Nhà hàng Chân Trời Góc Bể",
            "review_text": "Peter K\nRyde, Australia571 contributions\n0\nSurprisingly great, food and pricing\nDec 2023 • Family\nUnbelievably good. This restaurant offers fantastic seafood as fresh as can be and possibly one of the best restaurants in Vietnam where I've eaten.\nThe staff are professional and although not quite a family run restaurant it has a family feel. The surroundings are very rustic but I/we would eat here again without hesitation. A long way from anywhere that a tourist would consider visiting but thoroughly authentic experience.\nRead more\nWritten December 9, 2023",
